    "created_at": "2026-06-24T15:40:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-24T15:40:08Z",
    "body": "Indeed it feels a bit yuck, though it doesn't seem possible to change in a nice way as long as connected is defined in terms of document and fragment parsing requires a document. If we can wire up fragment parsing without a document that indeed seems much nicer, I can try and investigate that approach (unless this is already being worked on based on what is mentioned above?)",
