    "created_at": "2026-06-24T15:49:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-24T15:49:52Z",
    "body": "> An element inserted to a DocumentFragment is never connected so I think it would solve this.\r\n\r\nif persistent document fragment will ever exist, the element is connected \"*if the fragment is*\" so please consider the fact in the future there could be live/persistent document fragments, thank you!",
